"подсвечены."
msgstr ""
"The UI logic is as follows - the currently open element is highlighted in"
" blue. And if the ids are duplicated, then all elements with that id will"
" be highlighted."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/menu.rst:712
msgid ""
"Поэтому необходимо следить за уникальностью id элементов, и если элементы"
